<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-lg">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-100"></div>
          <img src="/annette-fernholz.jpg" alt="Attorney Portrait" class="object-cover relative z-10 transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105" style="min-height: 500px; width: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-slate-950/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold text-sky-800 transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">About the Attorney</span>
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">A Legacy of Exacting Precision</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-light">
          My practice is strictly dedicated to appellate family law. I serve clients who are facing complex, high-stakes appeals involving divorce, child custody, and significant property division. Over the course of my career, I have handled hundreds of appeals, analyzing sprawling trial records to pinpoint critical legal errors.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Because I limit my practice exclusively to the appellate arena, I bring a hyper-focused, objective perspective to every case. I am frequently brought in by other trial attorneys to preserve records or take over the helm when an aggressive appellate strategy is the only path forward.
        </p>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-sky-600 pl-6 py-2 mt-8">
          <blockquote class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-800 italic">
            "Appeals aren't won with emotion. They are won through strategic mastery of the law, a pristine record, and airtight legal writing."
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>